Package: aion
Title: Open-Source AI & Mathematical Computing Engine for R
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Aksel", "Aghajanyan", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "aksel@aqwel.ai")
Description: R interface to the high-performance Aion C++ core routines. Provides fast 1D numerical reductions, vector operations, matrix multiplication, rolling window statistics, and streaming histograms.
